<title>GERMANY: Duerr H1 pretax profit rises 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Duerr H1 pretax profit rises 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant construction group Duerr AG said on Wednesday a wave of incoming orders helped drive first-half pretax profit up by nine percent to 17.6 million marks.</p>
<p>The company also said sales in the period increased four percent to 627 million marks, and forecasted group results in 1997 would be &quot;essentially better&quot; than last year. It had 23.9 million marks in 1996 net income.</p>
</text>
